          "review": [{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Harshita"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"This variant is for the enthusiast who cares more about the raw ride experience and range than the in-depth software features of the 450X. It's the pure Ather DNA with the biggest battery range.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Pooja"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The availability of the 8-year/80,000 km battery warranty add-on (Stack Pro+) gives me phenomenal confidence in the long-term cost of ownership. It secures the value for the entire life of the scooter.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.9,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Kiran"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The light kerb weight (108 kg) is impressive for a scooter packing a 3.7 kWh battery. This lightweight design contributes massively to its famous quick and nimble handling.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Zoya"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The 7.45 hour full charging time feels excessive. While the 0-80% time is better, the overall reliance on overnight charging means less spontaneity on longer trips.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.3,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Deepak Taneja"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"Ather's commitment to quality is visible everywhere. The 170 mm high ground clearance and the low center of gravity make the scooter feel stable and capable on all road conditions.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Manish"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The inclusion of basic connected features like Turn-by-Turn Navigation and Call/Music Control via Bluetooth is just what I need. I don't need fancy app suites, just core functionality, which this provides.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Ritu"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The four ride modes (Eco, Ride, Sport, and Smart Eco) are well-calibrated. I use Smart Eco for maximum efficiency in city traffic and switch to Sport for highway overtakes. Great flexibility.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Vijay"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The boot space is small (22L), barely fitting my helmet and rain gear. For a scooter with long-range intent, I wish the practicality was better, similar to the spacious Rizta.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.7,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Neha Singh"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"I love the smart, subtle safety features like FallSafe™ (motor cuts off if it detects a fall) and AutoHold™ on inclines. These tech features demonstrate Ather's focus on rider security.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.9,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Gaurav"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The charging time is a drawback. 7 hours 45 minutes for 0-100% at home is very long. Ather Grid fast charging is essential for quick top-ups, but its availability near my home is still limited.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.8,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Sanjana"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The cycle parts are top-tier: Dual Disc Brakes (front and rear) and the robust aluminum chassis. It stops and handles like a premium machine, ensuring maximum safety on Delhi roads.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Anil"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The 7-inch DeepView™ display is an excellent compromise. It’s an LCD screen, not the full touchscreen of the X, but it’s crystal clear in sunlight and handles navigation and core functions perfectly.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Pooja"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The 3.7 kWh battery is a confidence booster. My real-world range is consistently over 120 km even with the AC on and riding aggressively. Range anxiety? What's that?","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Karan Malhotra"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The famed Ather performance is still present. 90 km/hr top speed and quick acceleration (0-40 km/h in 3.9s) make the daily commute a thrill. The sheer agility and stable chassis feel unmatched.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.1,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Dr. Riya Sharma"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"This scooter is the logical choice! It gives me the massive 161 km IDC range of the top-spec Ather without forcing me into the expensive TFT touchscreen of the 450X. Pure range value from Ather.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"isha"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I'm proud to own the Ather 450S. It's an amazing scooter with a futuristic design and comfortable ride. The only drawback is the limited range and lack of advanced features.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.8,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"srushti"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450S is a great option for city rides, offering a smooth ride and good performance. However, the charging time is a bit long.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"harish"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've enjoyed riding the 450S for its agility and comfort. However, the after-sales service experience could be improved.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"het"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The 450S is a good entry-level scooter, but it lacks in terms of advanced features and charging infrastructure support.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"dhaumya"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450S is a reliable scooter with a sporty feel. However, the range is limited, and more service centers would be beneficial.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"manas"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've been impressed with the 450S's handling and suspension. It's a joy to ride on both good and bad roads, though the pillion seat could be more comfortable.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"tilak"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450S is a solid choice for those seeking an affordable electric scooter. It's fun to ride, but the lack of advanced features is noticeable.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"jash"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I love the 450S for its futuristic design and comfortable ride. It's a great value for money, though the range could be better for longer commutes.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.8,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"neel kuber"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450S offers a smooth ride and good performance. However, the charging time is a bit long, and more charging stations would be beneficial.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"dhruv thakkar"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've had mixed experiences with the 450S. While it's efficient and easy to handle, there have been some issues with after-sales service and display reliability.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"aashmini"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450S is a great choice for city rides. It's agile and fun to ride, though the pillion comfort could be improved.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"prabhat ranjan"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've been impressed with the 450S's design and build quality. It's comfortable to ride, but the lack of a touch display is noticeable compared to other models.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.8,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"abhishek tiwari"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450S is a fantastic entry-level electric scooter. It offers a sporty ride and great performance, though the range could be better for longer trips","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}}]

